     * already terminal, SUSPENDED is read-only).
     *
     * Idempotent: re-calling on an already-cancelled event returns unchanged.
     *
     * Notification/automation side effects and the 30-day registration sweep
     * are handled outside this transaction via domain events and scheduled
     * cleanup.
